{'jobId': 19982, 'jobTitle': ' Middle/Senior Data Orchestration - Data Engineer', 'jobDesc': "MoMo's data platform processes petabytes of data through thousands of pipelines every day. It powers product analytics, business performance analysis, insight validation, and machine learning models for fraud detection, credit scoring, and personalization. Its reliability directly affects business decisions and product performance; We are moving from a platform built primarily on BigQuery toward a hybrid lakehouse across cloud and on-premises infrastructure. The shift addresses growing demands for data control, lower cost, and regulatory compliance. It also introduces harder operational problems: distributed compute, constrained capacity, platform migration, and the separation of workloads by data sensitivity; The Data Orchestration team owns data ingestion, movement between environments, and modeling for downstream users. You will build and operate pipelines and models as the platform moves to the lakehouse, keeping existing reports and data products dependable. Middle engineers own pipelines and models within the team's standards, with support on broader design decisions. Senior engineers set designs and standards, balance correctness, performance, and cost, and lead changes involving other teams; 
 ", 'jobResp': '
 Bring new data sources to the lakehouse . Build batch, CDC, and streaming pipelines from operational databases, backend services, Kafka, APIs, and partner feeds. Develop reusable ingestion components and frameworks so connecting new sources becomes repeatable and increasingly automated; Keep data accurate as sources change . Own data correctness from ingestion through transformation, with schema validation, data quality checks, and reconciliation against source data. Work with source owners to handle schema changes and prevent missing or duplicate records from affecting downstream users; Turn raw data into useful models. Build layered dbt models, from raw data through conformed entities to data marts for reporting, analytics, and data products. Work with Analytics and other data consumers to agree on business definitions and create models teams can reuse across BigQuery and the lakehouse; Scale processing at a sustainable cost . Improve Spark pipeline performance and resource efficiency as data volumes grow. Use production workload metrics to identify bottlenecks and balance runtime, reliability, and compute cost; Keep sensitive data protected. Work with Security and Data Infrastructure to ensure pipelines and models respect access controls and the separation of PII and PII-free workloads across environments; Own reliability in production. Keep Airflow workflows, pipelines, and data models dependable against agreed objectives for data freshness and availability. Use monitoring and alerts to detect failures, restore service, and prevent recurring incidents. Seniors set service objectives and guide decisions when problems span teams; 
 ', 'jobRequire': ' Must have 2+ years of experience in Data Engineering, Data Platform Engineering, or a related backend or infrastructure role, with production systems you built or ran; Strong SQL and hands-on experience with at least one of Python, Java, or Scala; Hands-on experience with at least one distributed data technology such as Apache Spark, Apache Flink, Kafka, BigQuery, or an MPP engine; Experience building and running scheduled or streaming pipelines in production, with Airflow or a similar orchestrator; A solid grasp of data fundamentals: data modeling, partitioning, incremental loads, and why a pipeline can produce a wrong result; Git, code review, and CI/CD as normal practice. Nice to have Experience with dbt or data quality and testing frameworks; Experience with open table formats such as Apache Iceberg, Delta Lake, or Apache Hudi; Experience with CDC and streaming ingestion tools such as Debezium or Kafka Connect; Experience with Kubernetes, Docker, and infrastructure as code (Terraform, Pulumi, Helm); Experience with monitoring and SRE practice, such as Prometheus, Grafana, SLOs, and on-call; Experience with GCP, AWS, or hybrid cloud and on-premise environments; Experience with payment, fintech, or other high-volume transaction data; Experience with data governance, access control, or data privacy requirements; In your application, tell us which of the areas above you would most like to work on. 
 ', 'reportTo': 'hai.nguyen1', 'divisionId': '5', 'divisionGroupId': 'DGM.0001', 'divisionGroup': 'Trung tâm Công nghệ Thông tin', 'locationPostJobId': 'PJL.0001', 'locationPostJob': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobTypeId': 'JBTY.0002', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0667', 'jobSubdirectory': 'middle-senior-data-orchestration-data-engineer-19982', 'isEducation': False, 'isRequireEducation': False, 'isAcademyTranscript': False, 'isRequireAcademyTranscript': False, 'isOnlineProfile': False, 'isRequireOnlineProfile': False, 'isMessToUs': False, 'isRequireMessToUs': False, 'isCurrentLocation': False, 'isRequireCurrentLocation': False, 'isGpa': False, 'isRequireGpa': False, 'isGraduationYear': False, 'isRequireGraduationYear': False, 'isCoverLetter': False, 'isRequireCoverLetter': False, 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'isAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isRequireAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isEducationLevel': True, 'isRequireEducationLevel': True, 'isName': True, 'isRequireName': True, 'isDob': False, 'isRequireDob': False, 'isPhone': True, 'isRequirePhone': True, 'isPersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isRequirePersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isTrack': False, 'isRequireTrack': False, 'isOtherAttachment': True, 'isRequireOtherAttachment': False, 'isGender': False, 'isRequireGender': False, 'isBuildProgram': False, 'isExperience': False, 'isRequireExperience': False, 'isMotivation': False, 'isRequireMotivation': False, 'motivation': None, 'relatedJobs': [{'Index': 0, 'jobId': '18242', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0410', 'jobTitle': 'Software Engineer II', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'software-engineer-ii-18242', 'original': 1, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 1, 'name': 'HOT'}}, {'Index': 0, 'jobId': '18478', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0399', 'jobTitle': 'Senior - Machine Learning Engineer', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'senior-machine-learning-engineer-engagement-personalization-18478', 'original': 2, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 3, 'name': 'NORMAL'}}], 'isPersonalInformationCurrentLocation': False, 'isRequirePersonalInformationCurrentLocation': False, 'isPreferredPosition': False, 'isRequirePreferredPosition': False, 'isFulltimeAvailability': False, 'isRequireFulltimeAvailability': False, 'isRelationshipWithMomoEmployees': False, 'isRequireRelationshipWithMomoEmployees': False, 'isEducationEvent': False, 'isRequireEducationEvent': False}

{'jobId': 19309, 'jobTitle': 'Expert Data Engineer - Data Infrastructure', 'jobDesc': "

 MoMo's data platform processes petabytes of data through thousands of pipelines. It powers product analytics, business performance analysis, insight validation, and machine learning models for fraud detection, credit scoring, and personalization. Its reliability directly affects business decisions and product performance; We are moving from a platform built primarily on BigQuery toward a hybrid lakehouse across cloud and on-premises infrastructure. The shift addresses growing demands for data control, lower cost, and regulatory compliance. Running our own infrastructure brings new demands: storage must stay fast and durable as workloads grow, while capacity and performance problems must be caught early; As our Expert System Engineer, you will own the storage and systems foundation of the lakehouse. You will build out and operate our new Ceph object storage cluster, defining how storage, networking, and operating systems work together as the platform grows. Your decisions will shape its performance, cost, and ability to recover from failure.


 ", 'jobResp': '

 Set the storage architecture . Define the storage topology and its network and operating system requirements. Evaluate open source, commercial, cloud, and hybrid options against production workloads, weighing cost, performance, and operational effort; Keep object storage dependable. Build and operate the Ceph cluster. Design pools and data placement, choose between replication and erasure coding, and balance usable capacity with durability; Keep data moving. Trace slow reads and writes across compute, clients, network, and storage. Tune concurrency, object size, client configuration, and access patterns using measurements from production workloads; Stay ahead of capacity limits. Forecast growth, set tiering and retention policies, and plan hardware expansion before capacity constrains workloads; Recover from failure. Handle disk and node loss, degraded states, and rebalancing under load. Plan upgrades, test backup restores, and rehearse disaster recovery; Strengthen the systems layer. Diagnose and tune Linux, filesystems, disks, and networking beneath the lakehouse. Work with network and infrastructure teams on topology, bandwidth, and hardware profiles; Make operations repeatable and visible. Automate provisioning, configuration, patching, and releases with tools such as Pulumi, Helm, and CI/CD. Instrument the storage layer so the team can spot degradation, explain slow jobs, and act before workloads fail. 
 ', 'jobRequire': '

 Must have 7+ years in systems, infrastructure, or storage engineering, including production systems you have designed, built, and operated at scale; Production experience with storage or other stateful distributed systems. You can explain architecture choices, diagnose performance, plan capacity, and recover from failures; Strong Linux systems knowledge. You can trace a bottleneck through the I/O path, filesystem, memory, and kernel, then verify that your change improved it; Data center networking experience. You can trace a throughput problem across NICs, switches, and network topology;

Hands-on experience with bare metal and on-premises infrastructure, including hardware sizing, provisioning, and patching; Clear technical writing. You can turn design decisions, benchmark results, and recovery procedures into documents other engineers can use; We also look for strong potential in engineers who have built and operated complex infrastructure. You do not need hands-on experience with Ceph or the other storage systems listed above if you can show how you learn unfamiliar systems and solve production problems. Nice to have Hands-on experience with Ceph, MinIO, GlusterFS, HDFS, or a commercial object store; Experience with Apache Iceberg or another open table format. You understand how small files, compaction, and partitioning affect storage behavior; Experience with Apache Spark. You understand how its read and write patterns affect object storage performance; 
 ', 'reportTo': 'hai.nguyen1', 'divisionId': '5', 'divisionGroupId': 'DGM.0001', 'divisionGroup': 'Trung tâm Công nghệ Thông tin', 'locationPostJobId': 'PJL.0001', 'locationPostJob': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobTypeId': 'JBTY.0002', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0566', 'jobSubdirectory': 'senior-lead-data-engineering-19309', 'isEducation': False, 'isRequireEducation': False, 'isAcademyTranscript': False, 'isRequireAcademyTranscript': False, 'isOnlineProfile': False, 'isRequireOnlineProfile': False, 'isMessToUs': False, 'isRequireMessToUs': False, 'isCurrentLocation': False, 'isRequireCurrentLocation': False, 'isGpa': False, 'isRequireGpa': False, 'isGraduationYear': False, 'isRequireGraduationYear': False, 'isCoverLetter': False, 'isRequireCoverLetter': False, 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'isAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isRequireAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isEducationLevel': True, 'isRequireEducationLevel': True, 'isName': True, 'isRequireName': True, 'isDob': False, 'isRequireDob': False, 'isPhone': True, 'isRequirePhone': True, 'isPersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isRequirePersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isTrack': False, 'isRequireTrack': False, 'isOtherAttachment': True, 'isRequireOtherAttachment': False, 'isGender': False, 'isRequireGender': False, 'isBuildProgram': False, 'isExperience': False, 'isRequireExperience': False, 'isMotivation': False, 'isRequireMotivation': False, 'motivation': None, 'relatedJobs': [{'Index': 0, 'jobId': '18242', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0410', 'jobTitle': 'Software Engineer II', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'software-engineer-ii-18242', 'original': 1, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 1, 'name': 'HOT'}}, {'Index': 0, 'jobId': '18478', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0399', 'jobTitle': 'Senior - Machine Learning Engineer', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'senior-machine-learning-engineer-engagement-personalization-18478', 'original': 2, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 3, 'name': 'NORMAL'}}], 'isPersonalInformationCurrentLocation': False, 'isRequirePersonalInformationCurrentLocation': False, 'isPreferredPosition': False, 'isRequirePreferredPosition': False, 'isFulltimeAvailability': False, 'isRequireFulltimeAvailability': False, 'isRelationshipWithMomoEmployees': False, 'isRequireRelationshipWithMomoEmployees': False, 'isEducationEvent': False, 'isRequireEducationEvent': False}

{'jobId': 18479, 'jobTitle': 'Senior/Lead - Software Engineer, AI & Data Team', 'jobDesc': '
 MoMo is the market leader in mobile payments in Vietnam. We strive to make every transaction fast, easy, and safe. Machine Learning is a core capability across our products, powering fraud detection, risk management, financial services, personalization, and many other experiences that impact millions of users every day.

We are looking for an experienced Machine Learning Engineer to join our Big Data & AI team. In this role, you will bridge the gap between Machine Learning research and production systems, helping turn models into reliable, scalable, and high-impact products.
 ', 'jobResp': '
 Build a large scale and high traffic microservices system; Design, build, and maintain scalable ML systems that serve real-time and batch predictions at scale; Develop feature pipelines, feature stores, model serving infrastructure, and data processing frameworks that power ML applications; Design and implement monitoring solutions to ensure model performance, data quality, system reliability, and business impact; Optimize ML systems for latency, scalability, availability, and maintainability in production environments; Contribute to the technical direction of ML infrastructure and platform engineering at MoMo. 
 ', 'jobRequire': '
 Must have 3-5+ years of experience in software engineering, machine learning engineering, or related fields; Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, distributed systems, APIs, testing, observability, and production operations; Experience building and operating production-grade Machine Learning systems at scale;

Hands-on experience with data processing frameworks, ML pipelines, and model deployment infrastructure; Solid understanding of Machine Learning concepts and the practical challenges of deploying and maintaining ML models in production; Proficiency in Python and experience with modern ML and data engineering ecosystems; Strong ownership mindset with a passion for building reliable, high-quality systems that deliver business impact; Collaborative and pragmatic approach to working with Data Scientists, Engineers, Product Managers, and other stakeholders; A builder mentality—you enjoy turning ideas and prototypes into production systems used by millions of users;

Fluently in using AI tools in every daily task. Nice to have Experience with MLOps, feature stores, model monitoring, experimentation platforms, or ML platform engineering; Familiarity with cloud-native technologies, Kubernetes, streaming systems, and large-scale data platforms. 
 ', 'reportTo': 'yen.tang', 'divisionId': '5', 'divisionGroupId': 'DGM.0001', 'divisionGroup': 'Trung tâm Công nghệ Thông tin', 'locationPostJobId': 'PJL.0001', 'locationPostJob': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobTypeId': 'JBTY.0002', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0343', 'jobSubdirectory': 'senior-lead-software-engineer-ai-data-team-18479', 'isEducation': False, 'isRequireEducation': False, 'isAcademyTranscript': False, 'isRequireAcademyTranscript': False, 'isOnlineProfile': False, 'isRequireOnlineProfile': False, 'isMessToUs': False, 'isRequireMessToUs': False, 'isCurrentLocation': False, 'isRequireCurrentLocation': False, 'isGpa': False, 'isRequireGpa': False, 'isGraduationYear': False, 'isRequireGraduationYear': False, 'isCoverLetter': False, 'isRequireCoverLetter': False, 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'isAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isRequireAvailabilityPeriod': False, 'isEducationLevel': True, 'isRequireEducationLevel': True, 'isName': True, 'isRequireName': True, 'isDob': False, 'isRequireDob': False, 'isPhone': True, 'isRequirePhone': True, 'isPersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isRequirePersonalDataAgreement': False, 'isTrack': False, 'isRequireTrack': False, 'isOtherAttachment': True, 'isRequireOtherAttachment': False, 'isGender': False, 'isRequireGender': False, 'isBuildProgram': False, 'isExperience': False, 'isRequireExperience': False, 'isMotivation': False, 'isRequireMotivation': False, 'motivation': None, 'relatedJobs': [{'Index': 0, 'jobId': '16201', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0060', 'jobTitle': 'Senior - AI Engineer, NLP', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'senior-ai-engineer-moni-16201', 'original': 1, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 3, 'name': 'NORMAL'}}, {'Index': 0, 'jobId': '16905', 'isMoMoTalent': False, 'jobCode': '26-ITC-0155', 'jobTitle': 'Senior AI Engineer, Inference', 'location': 'Hồ Chí Minh', 'jobType': 'Fulltime', 'subdirectory': 'ai-agent-engineer-ii-16905', 'original': 2, 'typePublic': {'typeId': 3, 'name'